{
    "$comment": [
        "Fixture slide catalogue. Read by `test/harness/data/fetch.mjs` (npm run fixtures:fetch),",
        "by `test/harness/data/derive.mjs` (which turns these into the viz-flex overlays),",
        "and by `docs/site/scripts/generate-fixtures.mjs`, which renders the docs catalogue page",
        "from it. One record per file, so a new fixture is one entry rather than an edit in",
        "three places plus a shell script nobody runs.",
        "",
        "`asset` = filename on the release named by `baseUrl`. `url` = an absolute third-party",
        "location, tried first when present, with `asset` as the mirror if it fails.",
        "`sha256: null` means not published yet: the fetcher refuses the item and says so.",
        "Set XOPAT_FIXTURE_BASE to point every `asset` at a mirror without editing this file.",
        "See README.md next to this file for the publishing procedure."
    ],

